  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/box100-800.html",
  "prefLabel": "Box 703.10 Event Plan",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Box 703.10 Event Plan. At least 10 days before a competition for which a permit has been granted, the promoter shall submit the following additional information:\n\n(1) Evidence of obtaining a performance bond and medical insurance for the competition;\n\n(2) Evidence of obtaining authorization from the city or town where the competition will be located;\n\n(3) Description of final public safety plan, including arrangements for law enforcement, private security guards, fire department, and emergency medical technicians;\n\n(4) Names of 2 medical doctors or physician's assistants who will attend the competition; and\n\n(5) Final list of referees, judges, scorekeepers, and timekeepers who will officiate at the competition.\n\nSource. #10483, eff 12-5-13; ss by #14066 eff 8-27-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/box100-800.html"
